1020
00:52:20,310 --> 00:52:23,930
So here's our
final setup of the

1021
00:52:24,410 --> 00:52:27,610
ventricles sort of
ghosted within the

1022
00:52:27,610 --> 00:52:29,710
brain here. So
this is all lateral

1023
00:52:29,710 --> 00:52:32,750
ventricle and the
